\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Comparison between traditional accuracy and the proposed XAI-based metrics (ETI and ERI). Although both Xception and the custom CNN achieve identical $99.45\%$ validation accuracy, Grad-CAM heatmaps reveal that the custom CNN relies on background context. The proposed ETI and ERI metrics successfully capture this flaw by producing lower scores for the custom model.}}{10}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:figure1}{{1}{10}{Comparison between traditional accuracy and the proposed XAI-based metrics (ETI and ERI). Although both Xception and the custom CNN achieve identical $99.45\%$ validation accuracy, Grad-CAM heatmaps reveal that the custom CNN relies on background context. The proposed ETI and ERI metrics successfully capture this flaw by producing lower scores for the custom model}{figure.1}{}}
